    {
      "id": "e22",
      "name": "TextBox 21",
      "hidden": false,
      "parentId": null,
      "inheritedFrom": null,
      "kind": "shape",
      "text": "Industry landscape: Players are pursuing a range of digital asset initiatives, from tokenizing deposits to joining global consortiums\nRegulatory and industry developments: The Canadian government recently introduced legislation for non-OSFI regulated players, while there are several developments in the industry influencing the digital assets space\nCollaboration between banks: In the absence of clear regulatory guidance for OSFI-regulated institutions, banks are collaborating through the CBA to advocate for a comprehensive framework\nDigital Assets Strategy approach: We have aligned on an enterprise approach to define the Digital Assets Strategy for the Bank with specific considerations by market (e.g., Canada, US, Latam)",
      "placeholder": null,
